gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月6日—7月10日（暂定），如时间有变化，以最新通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>申请条件</span></b></font></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/btLkCxjz5dIPrniaYfMlADS6j4XaqJSQVcX37XS2iak4uoASqATicoiaWtH9NSw1v6wRBww4YJlmlw8Zic4etaibatNuJb7doS6HibqJXveW6vjI0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、申请人应为“双一流”高校相关专业在读三年级本科生（即2027届应届本科毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>2、学习成绩优秀，专业综合排名前20%，英语水平良好，课程无重修或补考记录，未受过纪律处分；</span></p><p><span>3、具有浓厚的科研兴趣，有较好的科研潜力，有志于从事科研事业。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>网上报名</span></b></font></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/btLkCxjz5dIPrniaYfMlADS6j4XaqJSQVcX37XS2iak4uoASqATicoiaWtH9NSw1v6wRBww4YJlmlw8Zic4etaibatNuJb7doS6HibqJXveW6vjI0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>登录中国科学院大学夏令营网上申报系统 http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn，报名单位选择：“植物研究所”，填写报名信息，在备注栏中注明申请“生态学”方向夏令营。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>活动内容</span></b></font></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/btLkCxjz5dIPrniaYfMlADS6j4XaqJSQVcX37XS2iak4uoASqATicoiaWtH9NSw1v6wRBww4YJlmlw8Zic4etaibatNuJb7doS6HibqJXveW6vjI0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动包括学术讲座、研究组介绍、科研平台展示、师生交流、科研实践等。</span></p><p><span>具体组织形式以最新通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>提交申请材料</span></b></font></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/btLkCxjz5dIPrniaYfMlADS6j4XaqJSQVcX37XS2iak4uoASqATicoiaWtH9NSw1v6wRBww4YJlmlw8Zic4etaibatNuJb7doS6HibqJXveW6vjI0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年6月28日前，申请者将本人电子版申请材料按顺序制作成一个PDF文档（签字页须手签后扫描）发送至zhaosheng@ibcas.ac.cn。文件和邮件主题命名为“姓名+申请编号+本科高校名称+生态学”。</span></p><p><span>1、中国科学院大学2026年大学生夏令营申请表（报名网站下载并签字）；</span></p><p><span>2、已修课程成绩单原件；</span></p><p><span>3、英语四、六级成绩单复印件或体现自身英语水平的证明材料复印件；</span></p><p><span>4、其它能佐证兴趣和能力的重要材料（已发表论文或出版物、奖励证书等）复印件。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>入营通知</span></b></font></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/btLkCxjz5dIPrniaYfMlADS6j4XaqJSQVcX37XS2iak4uoASqATicoiaWtH9NSw1v6wRBww4YJlmlw8Zic4etaibatNuJb7doS6HibqJXveW6vjI0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>入营名单将于2026年7月初在植物所网站公布，并通过邮件通知入选者。未入选者，不另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击底部“阅读原文”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>了解更多植物所夏令营活动信息</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><sect